			(property "Description" "PCF8563 real-time clock module, board marking HW-689 (43 x 17 mm), I2C address 0x51, 1.0-5.5 V. 6-pin header VCC/GND/SDA/SCL/COT/INT in the order printed on the board. COT is the programmable clock output, INT is the open-drain alarm/timer interrupt (needs a pull-up if used). CR1220 backup cell holder on board (12.5 mm cell, 3.5 mm deep). The photographed board seems to have no I2C pull-ups: add 4.7k to 3V3 on the bus."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
